imized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5911630436","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117031#issuecomment-5911630436","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117031","id":5911630436,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABYFxSZA","user":{"login":"NoctemCat","id":22471296,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNDcxMjk2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22471296?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat","html_url":"https://github.com/NoctemCat","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-30T12:49:19Z","updated_at":"2026-09-30T13:08:53Z","body":"Sorry, I now actually found what it does https://github.com/emscripten-core/emscripten/blob/59f4772b815a13e48b4edcbdd5c74bf09104818c/tools/cmdline.py#L164:\r\n```python\r\ndef is_dash_s_for_emcc(args, i):\r\n  # -s OPT=VALUE or -s OPT or -sOPT are all interpreted as emscripten flags.\r\n  # -s by itself is a linker option (alias for --strip-all)\r\n```\r\nAnd replaced it with a safe direct linker flag:\r\n```python\r\n    elif arg.startswith('-Wl,'):\r\n      for flag in arg.split(',')[1:]:\r\n        add_link_arg(flag)\r\n    elif arg == '-Xlinker':\r\n      add_link_arg(get_next_arg())\r\n    elif arg in {'-s', '-Bstatic', '-Bdynamic'} or arg.startswith(('-l', '-L', '--js-library=', '-z', '-u')):\r\n      add_link_arg(arg)\r\n```\r\nHere is how linker uses it (https://github.com/llvm/llvm-project/blob/f34ff31c6521b4fa62a24122743d1e76a6756087/lld/test/wasm/strip-all.s#L6)\r\n```\r\n## Test alias -s\r\n# RUN: wasm-ld -s -o %t2.wasm %t.start.o\r\n```\r\n\r\nI really should have looked at the code and test cases first, no docs even mentioned it. Also why emscripten even allowed `-s` with space, when `-s` by itself is also an allowed flag...","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5911630436/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5915848695","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117031#issuecomment-5915848695","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117031","id":5915848695,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABYJyv9w","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site